Exploration confirms the plan's claims about existing proxy code are accurate (`ASSMUD_PROXY_MODE`/`AUTH_TOKEN`/`ORIGIN_ALLOWLIST` fail-closed, `/health`, `0.0.0.0:7788` all verified); all "missing" files are explicitly proposed D1/D2/U1 deliverables, not stale references.

